# Quality gates

- Static + WebGPU compile + smoke when shaders touched.
- Showcase budget gate: page gzip ≤400 KB, brotli ≤350 KB, critical ≤200 KB (`node source/budget-gate.mjs`). AEI Continuous owns ceilings — agents must not raise.
- Browser Enter with no pipeline errors for product ships.
- Failed workflows must not report success.
- Independent verification: re-run gates; implementer self-reports are not sufficient for “verified improvement.”
- `/release-review` stops before publish.
